Scope: isolated default-phase candidate test, first harness attempt.
The probe raised KeyError: 'body' while CDC status returned an early non-JSON HTTP response. The probe exited and terminated its own JVM. Before termination it did not create the CDC owner table in the random state schema. No CDC fault-window assertion was reached; this is a probe failure, not a product result. Raw JVM log is retained privately as /private/tmp/pekko-shutdown-candidate-default-1.log.
